DOpTC - Dissolved oxygen, ORP, pH, Temperature, and Conductivity
This project was developed as a lower cost alternative to commercial water quality sensors using Atlas Scientific and DFRobot sensor probes.
Data is transmitted using Particle (Boron boards) to a dashboard on ThingSpeak or Graphana.
Atlas Scientific sensors: ORP, pH, Conductivity       DFRobot sensor: DO and Temperature
Current student researchers: Victoria Makowski, Nelson Lau, Mason Leavins
Previous team members: Emma Herndon

Current code files:
DO and Temp: mosfet-do-channel2
